This is the rights-screened public companion to a controlled CTREND Revisit
research project. It originates from controlled source commit
58c8bad72d318eb7f17610084cc826bfbbbe9511. The controlled repository,
licensed inputs, detailed per-asset outputs and full production run trees are
not included. No access to the controlled repository is implied.

Fieberg, Liedtke, Poddig, Walker and Zaremba's original code and CTREND
workbook are from Harvard Dataverse doi:10.7910/DVN/NTIVT8, whose dataset
metadata lists CC0 1.0. The original package contains a separately noticed
BSD-licensed fGRS implementation by Sven Thies. This attribution does not
transfer rights in CMC data, auxiliary factors or MathWorks software.

The MATLAB helper files regstats2.m and parfor_wait.m, present in the
controlled project, have been omitted from this public export pending a
file-specific redistribution determination. CMC raw price, volume and market
capitalization matrices have likewise been omitted. See DATA_AVAILABILITY.md
and THIRD_PARTY_MATERIALS.csv for the disposition of each material class.
